%%{init: {'sequence': {'mirrorActors': false}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Member
    participant L as Library
    participant B as Book
    participant Loan as Loan

    note over M,Loan: Different message types in sequence diagrams
    M->>+L: borrowBook(member, book)
    note right of M: Synchronous call (->>): Sender waits
    L->>+B: checkAvailable()
    note right of L: Synchronous call: Blocks until response
    B-->>-L: isAvailable
    note right of B: Return message (-->>): Response with activation end
    L->>Loan: new Loan(member, book, dueDate)
    note right of L: Synchronous creation
    Loan->>L: 
    note right of Loan: Self-message (optional action on self)
    L-->>-M: confirmation
    note right of L: Return message: Deactivates Library
